    <briefdescription>
<para>RocksDB compaction filter for TT-core re-compression. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Targets <computeroutput>__ttcore__:</computeroutput> (raw <ref refid="structthemis_1_1storage_1_1_t_t_train" kindref="compound">TTTrain</ref>) and <computeroutput>__ttn__:...:meta:</computeroutput> (<ref refid="structthemis_1_1storage_1_1_quantized_train" kindref="compound">QuantizedTrain</ref>) key namespaces.</para>
<para><heading level="3">Usage</heading>
</para>
<para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">rocksdb::ColumnFamilyOptions<sp/>cf_opts;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">cf_opts.compaction_filter<sp/>=</highlight></codeline>
